  "explanation": {
    "en": "Equal highs are visible, so stops gather just above them. A sweep takes those orders; what happens next decides whether it was a sweep or a real breakout.",
    "bn": "Equal high চোখে পড়ে, তাই stop ঠিক ওপরে জমে। Sweep সেই order নেয়; পরে কী হয় তাই ঠিক করে এটা sweep ছিল না আসল breakout।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Liquidity is a level, the sweep is the event",
      "bn": "Liquidity একটি level, sweep একটি ঘটনা"
    }
  ],
